WEBVTT

00:09:28.606 --> 00:09:31.275
to activist issues so far.

00:09:32.234 --> 00:09:33.444
Not what you think it is,

00:09:33.485 --> 00:09:35.779
but what do your employees
think it's been?

00:09:36.322 --> 00:09:39.783
And in our research, we came up
with a kind of taxonomy

00:09:39.825 --> 00:09:42.494
of different leadership responses.

00:09:42.494 --> 00:09:45.456
It starts with nonexistent

00:09:45.497 --> 00:09:47.416
or, "Activism?

00:09:47.416 --> 00:09:48.626
What activism?"

00:09:49.627 --> 00:09:53.881
We talked to a chief executive
in the manufacturing industry.

00:09:54.632 --> 00:09:58.093
And midway through our conversation,
I asked him about climate change

00:09:58.093 --> 00:10:01.930
and his strategy and stance
on environmental issues.